    },
    {
      "displayText": "“Leftovers” is such a funny name for an item,\ndon’t you think?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "201C004C006500660074006F0076006500720073201D0020006900730020007300750063006800200061002000660075006E006E00790020006E0061006D006500200066006F007200200061006E0020006900740065006D002C000A0064006F006E2019007400200079006F00750020007400680069006E006B003F001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Leftovers, Leftovers, my heart you have won! ♪<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500660074006F0076006500720073002C0020004C006500660074006F0076006500720073002C0020006D007900200068006500610072007400200079006F00750020006800610076006500200077006F006E00210020266A001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Leftovers, Leftovers, are you loved by every ’mon?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500660074006F0076006500720073002C0020004C006500660074006F0076006500720073002C002000610072006500200079006F00750020006C006F00760065006400200062007900200065007600650072007900202019006D006F006E003F001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahem. As you can see, I take my job as a waitress\nvery seriously.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIn fact, I’m trying to help reduce food waste by\nteaching the world how useful Leftovers are!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 167
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Since you made the happy mistake of talking to\nme, you should pitch in to aid my mission!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThink you’d be up for a battle? My Pokémon will\nbe holding—you guessed it—Leftovers!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 182
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Come talk to me when you’re ready!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006D0065002000740061006C006B00200074006F0020006D00650020007700680065006E00200079006F00752019007200650020007200650061006400790021001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Would you like to battle my Pokémon and their\nhandy Leftovers?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006F0075006C006400200079006F00750020006C0069006B006500200074006F00200062006100740074006C00650020006D007900200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200061006E0064002000740068006500690072000A00680061006E006400790020004C006500660074006F0076006500720073003F001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll take ’em on!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C002000740061006B0065002020190065006D0020006F006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m good, thanks",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D00200067006F006F0064002C0020007400680061006E006B00730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK...but you’ll never find out why Leftovers are so\ngreat if you don’t see them in action.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Don’t be offended if you catch my Pokémon\nmunching during the battle.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJust think of it as part of their charm!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 118
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I guess even Leftovers can’t save you if all signs\npoint to defeat!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006700750065007300730020006500760065006E0020004C006500660074006F0076006500720073002000630061006E201900740020007300610076006500200079006F007500200069006600200061006C006C0020007300690067006E0073000A0070006F0069006E007400200074006F00200064006500660065006100740021001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Here—I’d like you to have some Leftovers of your\nown! They’re, errr, fresh...if that’s the right word.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you give your Pokémon Leftovers to hold, they’ll\nrecover HP periodically during battle.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPlus it’s really cute to see Pokémon chewing away\nwhile they’re serving up attacks!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 182
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh! I just realized...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680021002000490020006A0075007300740020007200650061006C0069007A00650064002E002E002E001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Leftovers never run out, right? Then can Pokémon\nkeep eating them forever?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIf so, I feel like that should count as one of the\nseven wonders of the Pokémon world!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n...Not that I know what the other six are.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
